 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "hey my internet is barely working and i'm paying way too much for this plan!! 😡",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Hello! Thanks for contacting Nimbus Telecom. I'm Ravi. I'm sorry to hear you're having trouble. I can definitely help you with that today.",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Before we dive in, could you please provide your account number for verification?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "it's 15838113. name is Karan Johnson.",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you, Karan. I can see how frustrating it is when your connection isn't performing as expected, especially when you feel the cost is too high.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "exactly!! and my phone is acting weird too, i think the sim card is dying 🙄",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I'm sorry about that. Let's get you on a cheaper plan first. I can move you to the Basic Connect plan which is $35 per month, starting from your next billing cycle on October 1st.",
      "tags": [
        "disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "that sounds way better. please do that. also can u fix the sim thing?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Of course. I will process the plan change now and send a confirmation SMS to 92359 89781 shortly. I'll also order a replacement SIM card to be sent to your home address immediately.",
      "tags": [
        "action:plan_change",
        "action:device_fix"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "thanks ravi! you've been great. i just need to pay my current balance too, here is my card: four six one nine two three nine six nine three seven two nine three zero two",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Payment received, thank you! Is there anything else I can assist you with today? To recap, I've lowered your plan and a new SIM is on its way. Have a wonderful day!",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "nope that's all. thanks again! 😊",
      "tags": []
    }
  ]
}
